# Vendored third_party (UxPlay, libplist, OpenSSL, ffmpeg) must keep exactly the line endings
# it was built and tested with: LF. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true otherwise
# silently rewrites shell/Perl scripts (ffmpeg's `configure`, openssl's util/*.pl, etc.) to
# CRLF, which breaks them under bash ("No such file or directory" on the shebang interpreter).
# See NOTES.md Phase 2.2 for the failure this caused.
app/src/main/cpp/third_party/** -text
